@host = https://localhost:7121

### Health check
GET {{host}}/health

### Semantic similarity (Development only)
POST {{host}}/dev/similarity
Content-Type: application/json


--RagDocsBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample-contract.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

### Delete a document (paste an id from the list)
DELETE {{host}}/documents/<id>